      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't even know if there's anyone i can talk to who wouldn't judge me. and even if there was, what's the point? the world is just built to make people like me feel like we don't belong. sometimes i look at it all and i just think... maybe i'm not supposed to be here. maybe it's just easier to just stop fighting entirely and find some peace.",
